// nvme2k.rc
// Version resource for stor98, the SCSI miniport for NVMe SSDs (9x and NT).
//
// Shipped under the stor98 name, not the upstream nvme2k/nvme9x names:
// clause 3 of the licence forbids using the upstream authors' names to
// endorse or promote this derived work.
